<title>USA: MCA names McGurk COO of motion picture unit.</title>
<headline>MCA names McGurk COO of motion picture unit.</headline>
<dateline>UNIVERSAL CITY, Calif. 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>MCA Inc on Monday named Walt Disney Co studio executive Chris McGurk to the newly-created position of chief operating officer for MCA's motion picture group.</p>
<p>In a statement, MCA, which is 80-percent owned by Seagram Co Ltd., said McGurk will oversee all strategic planning, international operations, finance and administration activities for the motion picture group.</p>
</text>
